'''Camp Narache''' is the starting town for the [[Tauren]], which is located in southern [[Mulgore]] at the northern edge of the [[Red Cloud Mesa]].  [[Tauren]] [[Shamans]] will find their first [[totem]] quest here for the [[Earth Totem]]. Camp Narache is the main village of the Hawkwind Tribe, and its [[Chief Hawkwind|Chief]] is a member of that Tribe. It has 5 buildings: the main tent (where Chief Hawkwind resides), a spirit lounge (with druid and shamans trainers), a bakery tent, an armory tent and a simple tent where the a trader stands selling normal things.

